ut in with SIDPP 840 psi.","mitigation":"Shut in well on annular preventer, circulated kick out via driller's method and raised MW from 9.9 to 10.5 ppg.","lesson_learned":"Flow-check every connection in Tipam; connection gas trends precede kicks.","source_doc":"WCR BGJ-12","event_date":"2013-12-12","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"BGJ-12 · 2,958 m"},{"id":182,"well_id":"BGJ-12","depth_m":3280.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Wellbore Instability","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":9.4,"mud_weight_ppg":10.5,"description":"Large cavings at shakers while drilling Barail at 3,280 m MD; erratic torque and fill on bottom after trip.","mitigation":"Increased mud inhibition and reduced surge/swab by slower trips; cavings reduced within 12 hrs.","lesson_learned":"Slightly higher MW in Barail reduces cavings without inducing losses.","source_doc":"WCR BGJ-12","event_date":"2013-12-30","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"BGJ-12 · 3,280 m"},{"id":183,"well_id":"BGJ-12","depth_m":3318.0,"formation":"Barail","event_type":"Torque Spike","severity":"Low","severity_rank":0,"npt_hours":1.5,"mud_weight_ppg":10.5,"description":"Torque increased sharply from 11.6 to 16.6 kft-lb at 3,318 m MD while drilling Barail; ROP dropped and stick-slip observed.","mitigation":"Reduced WOB/RPM, circulated bottoms-up and performed wiper trip to condition the hole.","lesson_learned":"Wiper trips every 150 m in Barail reduce pack-off and torque spikes.","source_doc":"WCR BGJ-12","event_date":"2014-01-01","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"BGJ-12 · 3,318 m"},{"id":184,"well_id":"BGJ-12","depth_m":3803.0,"formation":"Kopili","event_type":"Kick","severity":"Critical","severity_rank":3,"npt_hours":104.7,"mud_weight_ppg":12.4,"description":"Flow observed on connection at 3,803 m MD (Kopili); 116 bbl gain. Well shut in with SIDPP 686 psi.","mitigation":"Well shut in; recorded SIDPP 686 psi. Weighted up to 12.8 ppg using wait-and-weight method before resuming drilling.","lesson_learned":"Narrow window in Kopili: manage ECD carefully to avoid losses while holding the kick off.","source_doc":"DDR BGJ-12 · 2014-01-29","event_date":"2014-01-29","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"BGJ-12 · 3,803 m"},{"id":185,"well_id":"BGJ-12","depth_m":3830.0,"formation":"Kopili","event_type":"Kick","severity":"Medium","severity_rank":1,"npt_hours":5.8,"mud_weight_ppg":12.4,"description":"Drilling break followed by 111 bbl pit gain at 3,830 m MD in Kopili. Influx circulated out; MW raised to 13.0 ppg.","mitigation":"Flow-checked, closed BOP, circulated influx out and increased MW to 13.0 ppg with kill-line monitoring.","lesson_learned":"Raise MW before the Kopili transition; overpressure onset is sharp in this field.","source_doc":"WCR BGJ-12","event_date":"2014-01-30","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"BGJ-12 · 3,830 m"},{"id":186,"well_id":"BGJ-12","depth_m":3884.0,"formation":"Kopili","event_type":"Kick","severity":"Critical","severity_rank":3,"npt_hours":56.2,"mud_weight_ppg":12.6,"description":"Well kicked at 3,884 m MD on entering Kopili; pit gain 88 bbl, SIDPP 664 psi, SICP 948 psi. Gas units peaked at 1478.","mitigation":"Flow-checked, closed BOP, circulated influx out and increased MW to 13.1 ppg with kill-line monitoring.","lesson_learned":"Flow-check every connection in Kopili; connection gas trends precede kicks.","source_doc":"WCR BGJ-12","event_date":"2014-02-02","origin":"seed","document_id":null,"citation":"BGJ-12 · 3,884 m"},{"id":187,"well_id":"BGJ-12","depth_m":3932.0,"formation":"Kopili","event_type":"Kick","severity":"High","severity_rank":2,"npt_hours":12.5,"mud_weight_ppg":12.7,"description":"Drilling break followed by 78 bbl pit gain at 3,932 m MD in Kopili. Influx circulated out; MW raised to 13.6 ppg.","mitigation":"Shut in well on annular preventer, circulated kick out via driller's method and raised MW from 12.7 to 13.6 ppg.","lesson_learned":"Raise MW before the Kopili transition; ov